{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04898","headline":"故赵王属赠黄门侍郎上官公挽词 · 李乂","name":"故赵王属赠黄门侍郎上官公挽词","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"暮归泉壤隔，朝发城池恋。\n汉畤结愁阴，秦陵下悲霰。\n駸駸百驷驰，悯悯羣龙饯。\n石马徒自施，玉人终不见。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李乂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04898.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04898","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}